{#- Shared partial - the top-level `actions:` block (user-level
    customization). The merged actions mapping (profile vars + user layers,
    by name; scripts/sunbeam_workshop/vars.py build_vars_full) renders as
    block scalars sorted by name (dictsort) for deterministic output; `|-`
    plus indent(4, true) keeps every body valid YAML. Re-parse is exact for
    bodies without a trailing newline; `|-` normalizes a body's single
    trailing newline (block-scalar semantics, execution-inert under
    bash -elo pipefail). CRITICAL (plan trap 10): when the mapping is EMPTY
    this partial must emit ZERO bytes - the golden byte-identity baseline
    depends on it. Jinja comments only: nothing here may reach the rendered
    yaml. Included LAST in each profile template, after the connections
    include. -#}
{%- if actions -%}
actions:
{%- for name, body in actions | dictsort %}
  {{ name }}: |-
{{ body | indent(4, true) }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endif -%}
